                    },
                    {
                        "optionId": "6592008029c8c3e4dc76jhgt",
                        "optionValue": "Interviewer",
                        "optionText": "Hello, I'm [Your Name], a recent graduate from [University Name] with a degree in [Your Field]. During my studies, I gained practical experience through internships in [relevant area], and I'm now excited to apply my knowledge and skills in a professional setting.",
                        "optionImage": "",
                        "validOption": true,
                        "displayOrder": 1
                    },
                    {
                        "optionId": "6592008029c8c3e4dc76jhgt",
                        "optionValue": "Candidate",
                        "optionText": "I'm [Your Name], a recent graduate with a passion for [specific field or industry], eager to contribute my skills and learn from experienced professionals.\" In my free time, I compose poetry or paint, which shows that I am an artistic person who can also manage free time efficiently!",
                        "optionImage": "",
                        "validOption": true,
                        "displayOrder": 2
                    },
                    {
                        "optionId": "6592008029c8c3e4dc76jhgt",
                        "optionValue": "Candidate",
                        "optionText": "A good self-introduction example is when you tell people about yourself in a clear and friendly way.\n You can mention your name, where you're from, what you do, and some things you like.",
