                        "validOption": true,
                        "displayOrder": 2
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "moduleName": "Virtual Interviews",
                "totalInstruction": 3,
                "completedInstruction": 2,
                "questionType": "INSTRUCTIONS",
                "templateType": "highLightInstruction",
                "quetionTitle": "Let’s look at an example of a detailed introduction",
                "hintText": "",
                "hintImage": "",
                "displayOrder": 2,
                "hasMultiAnswers": true,
                "imageUrl": "dads",
                "option": [
                    {
                        "optionId": "6592008029c8c3e4dc76jhgt",
                        "optionValue": "",
                        "optionText": "Hi, I am Shakeel. I am from Delhi. I completed my English Honors from Hindu College which is affiliated to Delhi University. I completed my twelfth grade from Delhi Public School with 89% from CBSE Boards.",
                        "optionImage": "",
                        "validOption": false,
                        "displayOrder": 1
                    },
                    {
                        "optionId": "6592008029c8c3e4dc76jhgt",
                        "optionValue": "",
                        "optionText": "My family includes my father who is an engineer, my mother who is a lawyer and my brother who is pursuing his MS in Computer Science from Cornell University. I love playing chess and have represented my school in various district and state level chess competitions.",
                        "optionImage": "",
                        "validOption": false,
                        "displayOrder": 2
                    },
                    {
                        "optionId": "6592008029c8c3e4dc76jhgt",
                        "optionValue": "",
                        "optionText": "I am also a part of Rotary Club where I have participated in community service at various schools teaching the underprivileged and visiting a number of old age homes. Being part of the Rotary Club has given me a different perspective of life which makes me appreciate what I am and where I am.”",
                        "optionImage": "",
                        "validOption": false,
                        "displayOrder": 3
                    },
                    {
                        "optionId": "6592008029c8c3e4dc76jhgt",
                        "optionValue": "",
                        "optionText": "I am a passionate and dedicated individual who recently completed a degree in Electrical Engineering. During my studies, I focused on subjects like circuit design, power systems, and electronics.",
                        "optionImage": "",
                        "validOption": false,
                        "displayOrder": 4
                    },
                    {
                        "optionId": "6592008029c8c3e4dc76jhgt",
                        "optionValue": "",
                        "optionText": "I also had the opportunity to work on hands-on projects, including designing and implementing a small-scale power distribution system. I am fascinated by the possibilities of renewable energy and its impact on sustainability.",
                        "optionImage": "",
                        "validOption": false,
                        "displayOrder": 5
                    },
                    {
                        "optionId": "6592008029c8c3e4dc76jhgt",
                        "optionValue": "",
                        "optionText": "I am eager to apply my technical skills and contribute to the development of innovative solutions in the field. I am a team player, detail-oriented, and open to learning from experienced professionals to further enhance my knowledge and expertise.",
                        "optionImage": "",
                        "validOption": false,
                        "displayOrder": 6
                    }
                ]
